@baseUrl = http://localhost:5159/api

### Listar muestras (por defecto page=1, pageSize=10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/samples?page=1&pageSize=10

### Registrar muestra
POST {{baseUrl}}/samples
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentNumber": "1001006",
  "fullName": "Pedro Pérez",
  "sampleType": "Sangre",
  "collectedAt": "2026-10-28T08:30:00",
  "testCodes": ["HEM01", "GLU02"]
}

### Registrar con código inexistente (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/samples
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentNumber": "1001006",
  "fullName": "Pedro Pérez",
  "sampleType": "Sangre",
  "collectedAt": "2026-10-28T08:30:00",
  "testCodes": ["HEM01", "XYZ99"]
}

### Cambiar estado
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/samples/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Recibida" }

### Rechazar sin motivo (400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/samples/3/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Rechazada" }

### Transición no permitida (409)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/samples/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Recibida" }
